"P1106459998" "We got us a problem. I got a call about some Wailer demons breaking into an office in the Golden Giza. There ain't been problems in the Giza with demons before, so we best take care of this pronto before it develops into something worse. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Clear the Wailers out of the casino office.</A>"
