// IntroString :
"P265477626" "So the Wailers have been going nuts trying to steal souls around the Rogue Isles. What's more, they convinced the Carnival of Shadows to help them break into Babylon and the Golden Giza! I really don't like the sound of this 'Chaos Affair' the Carnival is talking about either. We should find out more about this event and what they're planning to do there. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Start interrogating the Carnival of Shadows to find out more about the Chaos Affair.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1413965547" "Interrogate Carnival"
// SendOffString :
"P3816876766" "We better find out where this Chaos Affair is happening, and fast."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3014132925" "You found out where and when this Chaos Affair is? Get goin'!"

