// Dialog :
"P1936238769" "Excellent work, {VillainName}. You helped prevent the Carnival and the Wailers from laying waste to St. Martial. We may be villains, but it doesn't mean we can't protect our own."
// RandomFameString :
"P3855511409" "You hear about the Carnival street fair in St. Martial? {VillainName} busted up the party!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4090899757" "Well, that was a bloody mess. Arachnos managed to send in some troops to clean up the mess and restore the ward, but a lot of people died screaming. Ah well - I guess we're just not cut out to be heroes."
// RandomFameString :
"P1661971385" "There was all kinds of fighting going on in St. Martial! I know {VillainName} was seen there!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P2941129052" "What was going on with the Carnival street fair on St. Martial? I heard {VillainName} bust it up! Loser!"
